<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Tyndall half year profit up 23.8 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Tyndall half year profit up 23.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    8.54  vs  7.02</p>
<p>    Net				     8.15  vs  6.58</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		    2.5   vs  2.5</p>
<p>    Sales				  21.45  vs  18.44</p>
<p>    Other income			  9.01  vs   7.96</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   5.44  vs   5.23</p>
<p>    Tax				     0.40  vs  0.44</p>
<p>    Interest				0.63  vs  1.08</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  0.87  vs  1.06</p>
<p> Dividend is 100 pct franked</p>
<p> Pay date Oct 25</p>
<p> Reg date Oct 11</p>
<p>NOTE - Tyndall Australia Ltd is a financial services group and is 52 percent owned by Sir Ron Brierley's Guinness Peat Group Plc.  </p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
